-Find all events that occurred outside of business hours (before 9 AM or after 5PM), on any given date:
-
-```esql
-FROM sample_data
-| WHERE DATE_EXTRACT("hour_of_day", @timestamp) < 9 AND DATE_EXTRACT("hour_of_day", @timestamp) >= 17
-```
