-## `COUNT_DISTINCT` [esql-count_distinct]
-
-**Syntax**
-
-:::{image} ../../../../../images/count_distinct.svg
-:alt: Embedded
-:class: text-center
-:::
-
-**Parameters**
-
-`field`
-:   Column or literal for which to count the number of distinct values.
